{"id": "56401", "title": "当官要会抱大腿：市委一秘", "author": "野贼僧", "category": "都市言情", "count": 499, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/56/56401.htm", "intro": "云州市水利局副主任科员刘睿，单位里被美女上司无情欺压，家里面老婆红杏出墙，陷入了人生最低谷。在一次防汛检查时，他跟上司赵珊珊闹翻，在厮打中强迫她发生了关系，事后才知她是市公安局长的儿媳。暴雨突至，山洪暴发，刘睿凑巧救了省里某位高官，自此便抱上这条粗腿，在官场呼风唤雨、步步高升，金钱美女享用不尽，甚至摇身一变成了省长女婿……华丽的人生转变说明，什么官场厚黑学，什么官场潜规则，完全可以无视，只要抱定大腿即可。", "base": "files/article/html/56/56401", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "美女上司 上", "file": "7865910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "美女上司 中", "file": "7865912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "美女上司 下", "file": "7865914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "怒而用强 上", "file": "7865916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "怒而用强 下", "file": "7865919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "骑士风采 上", "file": "7865921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "骑士风采 下", "file": "7865924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暗算 上", "file": "7865927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暗算 下", "file": "7865929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冤家 上", "file": "7865931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冤家 下", "file": "7865933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "洪水突至 上", "file": "7865935.html", "available": false}, {"title": "洪水突至 下", "file": "7865936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "路见危难", "file": "7865937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "救人 上", "file": "7865940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "救人 下", "file": "7865943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "福祸造来终有报 上", "file": "7865946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "福祸造来终有报 下", "file": "7865949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "回城 上", "file": "7865953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "回城 下", "file": "7865955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "家有嫌妻 上", "file": "7865957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "家有嫌妻 下", "file": "7865958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "夫妻吵架 上", "file": "7865961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "夫妻吵架 下", "file": "786